    {
      "key": "exercise-275",
      "serialized": "下列数列[[MATH:0]]是等差数列还是等比数列？设： a) [[MATH:1]]，[[MATH:2]]； b) [[MATH:3]]，[[MATH:4]]； c) [[MATH:5]]，[[MATH:6]]； d) [[MATH:7]]，[[MATH:8]]如果数列是等差数列，就指出它的公差；如果数列是等比数列，就指出它的公比.",
      "lines": [
        "下列数列[[MATH:0]]是等差数列还是等比数列？设：",
        "a) [[MATH:1]]，[[MATH:2]]；",
        "b) [[MATH:3]]，[[MATH:4]]；",
        "c) [[MATH:5]]，[[MATH:6]]；",
        "d) [[MATH:7]]，[[MATH:8]]如果数列是等差数列，就指出它的公差；如果数列是等比数列，就指出它的公比."
      ],
      "formulas": [
        {
          "tex": "(a_n)",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "a_1=5",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "a_{n+1}=4a_n",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "a_1=5",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "a_{n+1}=4+a_n",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "a_1=-8",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
        },
        {
          "tex": "a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{2}+a_n",
          "visible": true,
          "nonempty": true
